TarkovMapLite — third-party material and disclaimers
=====================================================

1. Map artwork
--------------
Assets/maps/**/*.png are rasterised from the map SVGs in tools/maps-src/.
Those SVGs come from the tarkov.dev map resources (https://github.com/the-hideout/tarkov-dev),
which in turn are traced from maps that belong to the game.

  * The PNGs here are derivatives (rendered at ~4000 px on the long edge,
    one image per floor with the ground layer hidden).
  * They are provided for personal, non-commercial use together with this tool.
  * All rights to the original game artwork belong to Battlestate Games Limited.

If you are a rights holder and want a map removed, open an issue and it will be
deleted.

2. Game data
------------
Assets/data-seed.json is a snapshot of:

  * https://json.tarkov.dev/pve/tasks        (+ tasks_zh translations)
  * https://json.tarkov.dev/pve/items        (+ items_zh translations)
  * https://json.tarkov.dev/pve/maps         (+ maps_zh translations)

fetched on 2026-11-07. Task and item text, translations, loot spawn points,
extract and transit positions all originate from that API (project: tarkov.dev,
by the-hideout). Only the records referenced by task objectives are kept.

